        {
            "aliases": [
                "AQUAVINE_HELP_LOTORPEDO"
            ],
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "EXCITED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Haha! Let's start a whole aquarium up in the skies!",
                            "zh": "哈哈！我们在天上造一个水族馆吧！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "crazydave",
                        "Action": "SPECIAL2",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "I'd LOVE to see our aquatic plants fight zombies high up in the skies!",
                            "zh": "我可太想看见水生植物在万米高空作战了！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "EXCITED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Actually, User Dave, the Aqua Vine buffs specific amphibious plants planted in it!",
                            "zh": "实际上，用户戴夫，水藤能加强部分种在里面的两栖植物！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "EXCITED",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Furthermore, Aqua Vine itself does considerate amount of damage, making it a great trasition plant that takes up no space!",
                            "zh": "更酷的是，水藤是不占格子且输出可观，非常适合用来开局过度！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "winnie",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "But, planting Lotorpedo\n(es) inside Aqua Vines could cause some unintended side effects......",
                            "zh": "但是，将鱼雷莲蓬种在水藤里可能会有意想不到的副作用……"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
